One or two arguments: file name and optional URL
—
Static Treat the specified attached file as a library from which you can do IMPORT. The syntax type for the library is determined from the file extension: .sql: For the YQL dialect of SQL (recommended).
.yqls: For s-expressions. Example with a file attached to the query: PRAGMA library("a.sql");
