Static Interpret the specified attached file as a library and override one of the package libraries with it. The file name should be in the format project_name/package_name/maybe/nested/module/name.EXTENSION, PRAGMA Library extensions are supported. Example: PRAGMA package("project.package", "/path/to/package");
PRAGMA override_library("project/package/maybe/nested/module/name.sql");

