yt set //home/dev/test_table/@primary_medium ssd_blobs
yt mount-table //home/dev/test_table --sync You can speed up the move further with forced_compaction but using this method creates a heavy load in the cluster and is strongly discouraged. To verify that the table has in fact changed its medium, use the command below: $ yt get //home/dev/test_table/@chunk_media_statistics

